WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
Zu Xuejing has never had this kind of reaction before

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,920
It's just contaminated by the foreign atmosphere.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,620
Since the female monarch insists that she is a phoenix

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,180
Then there's no need to fight anymore

5
00:00:13,540 --> 00:00:15,540
Let her enter the Nie Pan Fire Pool

6
00:00:15,820 --> 00:00:22,620
It would be better if her ancestor Xuejing had not come out earlier.

7
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:24,260
Brother Wolf still has to spread the fire by himself

8
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:28,260
Why are these Phoenix Yanxue so stubborn that she can't get in?

9
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:31,380
Zu Xuejing does not show the bloodline of the Phoenix clan

10
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:33,140
She didn’t dare to enter the Nie Pan Fire Pond

11
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,700
Then admit that she is a foreigner

12
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:37,540
A foreigner takes the identity of the Phoenix Princess

13
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:38,500
Live in Wu Tongshan

14
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:40,940
How is the queen going to explain to the whole clan?
